From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Open Arc Authors <dev@openarc.invalid>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:26:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] openarc: embedder: add the //openarc embedder and bring-up
 host

New top-level directory for Open Arc's embedder of Chromium (plans C6, C8):

- app/: OpenArcMainDelegate. In the browser process it runs
  BrowserMainRunner::Initialize() and attaches the UI thread to the
  app's run loop (patches 0001-0002); ShutdownBrowser() tears down.
  openarc_helper_main.cc is the child-process executable (seatbelt,
  then dlopen ../OpenArcCore from the framework's Helpers/ directory ->
  OACChildProcessMain).
- browser/, common/: content-level ContentBrowserClient, BrowserMainParts
  (owns display::Screen and one BrowserContext per profile), content
  client, per-tab web preferences (prefers-color-scheme), paths relative
  to OpenArcCore.framework. TODO(C6b): derive from //chrome's
  ChromeMainDelegate / ChromeContentBrowserClient (decision Q7).
- bridge/: the Objective-C API of OpenArcCore (public headers mirrored
  from the Open Arc repo's chromium-bridge/include): OACBrowserApplication,
  OACApplication start/shutdown, OACProfile, OACTab (owns its
  WebContents; state, navigation, favicon, theme color, find, snapshot,
  zoom, color scheme, hovered link, unhandled keys, close callbacks),
  OACNewTabRequest (URL requests and script-opened windows to adopt) and
  OACJavaScriptDialogRequest (alert/confirm/prompt/beforeunload through
  the tab's JavaScriptDialogManager). Callbacks are posted with
  CFRunLoopPerformBlock in common modes so they still run inside
  -[NSApplication terminate:]'s nested loop.
- shell_test/: openarc_shell_test, a bare NSWindow host that starts the
  engine, creates one profile and one tab and loads a URL.
- BUILD.gn: openarc_framework (OpenArcCore.framework, plan C8: library
  with install name @rpath/OpenArcCore.framework/Versions/A/OpenArcCore,
  exports limited to the OAC* API and OACChildProcessMain by
  bridge/OpenArcCore.exports, Headers/ + Modules/module.modulemap,
  Resources/ with openarc.pak, ICU data and the V8 snapshot, Helpers/
  with the unbundled openarc_helper, Libraries/ with SwiftShader),
  openarc_helper, openarc_shell_test (links the framework), openarc_pak.
  Not referenced from //BUILD.gn; the out dir adds the framework and the
  test host with root_extra_deps.

Helper apps and their sandbox profiles are C10.
